{
  "key": "letter-013-part-01",
  "number": 13,
  "generationId": "01a1e4e9-5af4-7a5a-9a14-8bf8493e7ebf",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "My respects to you.",
      "path": "audio/1963-13/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.2355330000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I have just returned from Rajnagar in Rajasthan.",
      "path": "audio/1963-13/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.512653,
      "end": 5.54737
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "I was invited to a religious function there organized by Acharya Shree Tulsi.",
      "path": "audio/1963-13/03.mp3",
      "start": 6.903107,
      "end": 11.614263
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I put four hundred monks and nuns through an experiment in meditation.",
      "path": "audio/1963-13/04.mp3",
      "start": 13.019569,
      "end": 16.766893
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The results were extraordinary.",
      "path": "audio/1963-13/05.mp3",
      "start": 18.099161,
      "end": 19.746599
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "In my view, meditation is the essence of all religious practice.",
      "path": "audio/1963-13/06.mp3",
      "start": 21.08966,
      "end": 25.074626000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "All the rest - such as non-violence, renunciation of wealth, celibacy etc. - are just its consequences.",
      "path": "audio/1963-13/07.mp3",
      "start": 26.529206,
      "end": 33.693673
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "With the attainment of samadhi, the culmination of meditation, all these things come by themselves, they just happen naturally.",
      "path": "audio/1963-13/08.mp3",
      "start": 35.077347,
      "end": 42.797323999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Since we forgot this central sadhana all our efforts have been external and superficial.",
      "path": "audio/1963-13/09.mp3",
      "start": 44.585215000000005,
      "end": 50.349433
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "True sadhana is not just ethical, it is basically yoga practice.",
      "path": "audio/1963-13/10.mp3",
      "start": 52.093469000000006,
      "end": 57.29
    }
  ]
}
